<p>Protesters broke into Kuwait’s consulate in Basra after a rocket fired from the direction of Kuwait hit the southern Iraqi city and killed at least three people, according to police sources and multiple reports published on April 7. One report put the death toll at at least five, suggesting casualty figures were still shifting in the early coverage. The available reports focus on the immediate unrest at the consulate and the claim that the rocket came from the direction of Kuwait, but they do not offer verified details about who was responsible or how much damage was done inside the consulate.</p><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/7/protesters-in-iraq-swarm-kuwaiti-consulate-after-deadly-rocket-attack'>Protesters in Iraq swarm Kuwaiti consulate after deadly rocket attack</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/protesters-break-into-kuwaiti-consulate-in-iraqs-basra-after-rocket-attack-kills-three'>Protesters break into Kuwaiti consulate in Iraq’s Basra after rocket attack kills three</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.axios.com/2026/04/07/iran-2-week-ceasfire-trump-pakistan'>At least five people are killed after a rocket fired from Kuwait landed in Basra, southern Iraq.</a> - axios.com</li><li><a href='https://www.turkiyetoday.com/region/protesters-storm-kuwaits-consulate-in-iraqs-basra-after-rocket-kills-three-3217644?s=1'>Protestors storm the Kuwaiti consulate in Basra, Iraq, after a rocket attack launched from Kuwait killed three people in Basra.</a> - turkiyetoday.com</li></ul>